{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2022-08-25 13:15:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS LAND SYSTEMS TO PROVIDE ABRAMS TANKS TO POLAND UNDER $1.1 BILLION FOREIGN MILITARY SALES ORDER', 'text': 'POLISH ARMY TO RECEIVE 250 TANKS IN THE STATE-OF-THE-ART M1A2 SEPV3 CONFIGURATION \xa0 STERLING HEIGHTS, MICH. , AUG. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAL DYNAMICS LAND SYSTEMS, A BUSINESS UNIT OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE: GD), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A FOREIGN MILITARY SALES ORDER FROM THE U.S. ARMY WORTH UP TO $1.148 BILLION TO DELIVER 250 M1A2 SEPV3 ABRAMS MAIN BATTLE TANKS TO POLAND.'}